From 9b16f49cf1f024cc4fa24aa86c9d89bab9de6d3f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 00:07:09 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] rc/httpd/webui: v1.2.8 - QoS v3 (aggregate cap, guaranteed
 minimums, DSCP trust, live stats) + native Traffic Manager page

Engine (type 11 upgraded in place; on-metal tmctl capability probe 2026-07-10
confirmed the Runner TM supports all of this unexposed):
- rc/qos.c start_hwqos_classful: emit --minrate from the min half of the
  qos_orates pairs (v2 parsed and ignored it); guarantee clamped to its
  ceiling. Port shaper pinned to qos_obw after queue setup = true aggregate
  cap (ceilings become burst allowances; combined egress can no longer spill
  into the ISP buffer when several classes saturate). Stop branch resets the
  port shaper and clears minrates with the ceilings.
- rc/qos.c add_qos_rules: DSCP trust block (qos_dscp_trust=1 + classful only)
  mapping EF/CS5-7->Q1, CS4/AF4x->Q2, CS3/AF3x->Q3, CS1->Q5, placed after
  explicit user rules and before the default catch-all; v4+v6.
- shared/defaults.c: qos_pshaper=1, qos_minrates=1 (kill-switch semantics:
  literal "0" = off), qos_dscp_trust=0 (policy toggle - LAN hosts influence
  their own class - so opt-in).

httpd:
- web.c do_reaper_qos_stats_cgi + reaper_qos_stats.cgi (do_auth): tmctl
  getqstats for WAN qids 0..6 as JSON; no request input consumed, ifname
  charset-guarded like start_hwqos.
- reaper_inject.c: skip-list Reaper_QoS.asp (native page, own chrome).

www:
- NEW Reaper_QoS.asp: dashboard-native Traffic Manager page. Mode cards with
  plain-language descriptions (Off/Classful/HW/Cake/Traditional/BwLimiter;
  Adaptive retired with the DPI stack), bandwidth panel with measured-rate
  guidance, classful editor (order/name/min/ceiling + live per-class rate and
  drop columns via 3s stats poll), three feature toggles (neutral grey), FAQ
  tuning-guide fly-out (8 sections incl. suggested WFH/gamer/office setups).
  Validation: all-zero ceilings rejected (U2 carried over), min>ceiling
  clamped, min-sum>100 blocked, ceiling-sum warning only when the aggregate
  cap is off. Same-mode edits apply live (restart_qos;restart_firewall);
  mode/enable switches confirm-then-reboot (stock HND accelerator semantics).
- reaper_shell.asp: frame CSS injector now skips pages carrying
  <meta name="reaper-native"> - convention for self-themed native pages.
- menuTrees/menuTree.js + Main_ReaperDash.asp rail: QoS tab -> Reaper_QoS.asp
  (stock QoS_EZQoS.asp still ships, linked for the BW-limiter editor).

Mock-validated (render + FAQ fly-out). EXTENDNO=Reaper_v1.2.8.
Metal tests owed: getportshaper/getqcfg show cap+minrates after apply; DSCP
toggle classifies an EF flow to Q1; live stats move under a bulk upload;
engine-switch reboot path; U2 editor guards; stock page still reachable.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
